{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：03:03 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：03:03 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：03:03 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"美國國會推新法案 阻特朗普與俄羅斯交易柴油 油價即升2% \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97f578d165ebb3ab2f79a1361cf831bb/2026-10/oil_terminal_1200x676_0.jpg\"/><p>美國眾議院跨黨派議員提出新法案，嘗試阻止總統特朗普與俄羅斯進行柴油交易。</p><p>眾議院外交事務委員會民主黨首席議員Gregory W. Meeks認為，這宗是不道德的交易，朗普政府沒有與烏克蘭站在一起，違背美國所代表的原則。</p><p>受消息刺激，紐約期油價格急升約2%。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T19:19:06.835057+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T19:03:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T22:12:08.243213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:17:44.821029+00:00","content_hash":"944b06eb3be883593e884e64a7a62fd1f4fa21dfc359b26c98209b6cfbd90546","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}